// The cycle runs through a generic INSTANCE's payload: A embeds Option<A>,
// whose Some variant embeds A by value inside the union.  A skeleton-only walk
// cannot see it — the resolved field names `Option_A`, and its concrete fields
// are the edges.  Both compilers used to accept this and emit C that cc
// rejected with "field '_0' has incomplete type" — three passes too late.
struct A { o: Option<A> }
fn main() { println(1); }
